# Interactive dynamic MCMB/LIDL vertical-envelope gate for licensed BADA 4.2.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-vertical
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM VERTICAL ENVELOPE INTERACTIVE GATE ===
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST INFO This gate compares VS magnitude and direction against MCMB ROC and LIDL ROD bounds.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST INFO VS command inputs are feet per minute. 10000 fpm equals 50.80 m/s.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE VCR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.10>CRE VCE,A320-232,41.32,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.20>CRE VDR,A320-232,41.34,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.30>CRE VDE,A320-232,41.36,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.40>DYNAMICS VCR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.50>DYNAMICS VCE TEM
00:00:01.60>DYNAMICS VDR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.70>DYNAMICS VDE KINEMATIC
00:00:02.00>ECHO TEST INFO Preparing safe 500 fpm climb/descent targets before enabling checks.
00:00:02.10>ALT VCR FL300 500
00:00:02.20>ALT VCE FL300 500
00:00:02.30>ALT VDR FL100 -500
00:00:02.40>ALT VDE FL100 -500
00:00:02.50>ENVELOPECHECKS VCR CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:02.60>ENVELOPECHECKS VCE CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:02.70>ENVELOPECHECKS VDR CUSTOM ROD_MAX
00:00:02.80>ENVELOPECHECKS VDE CUSTOM ROD_MAX
00:00:03.00>ENVELOPE VCR REPORT
00:00:03.10>ENVELOPE VCE ENFORCE
00:00:03.20>ENVELOPE VDR REPORT
00:00:03.30>ENVELOPE VDE ENFORCE
00:00:04.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-vertical.csv
00:00:04.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY event before the following excessive VS commands.
00:00:05.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding +10000 fpm or +50.80 m/s. This is far above the roughly +7 m/s MCMB bound.
00:00:05.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT VCR should REPORT and VCE should ENFORCE its MCMB maximum.
00:00:05.10>VS VCR 10000
00:00:05.20>VS VCE 10000
00:00:05.30>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding a 10000 fpm or 50.80 m/s descent magnitude. This is far above the roughly 8 m/s ROD maximum.
00:00:05.35>ECHO TEST EXPECT VDR should REPORT and VDE should ENFORCE its LIDL minimum.
00:00:05.40>VS VDR -10000
00:00:05.50>VS VDE -10000
00:00:06.00>ECHO TEST INFO BlueSky ramps vertical speed. QUALITY events are expected as each bound is reached.
00:00:14.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT VCR and VDR REPORT INFEASIBLE. VCE and VDE ENFORCE VALID.
00:00:14.10>PERFSTATUS VCR
00:00:14.20>PERFSTATUS VCE
00:00:14.30>PERFSTATUS VDR
00:00:14.40>PERFSTATUS VDE
00:00:15.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:15.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_vertical_envelope_run.py on pybada-envelope-vertical.csv.
00:00:16.00>HOLD
